        "rules": [
          {
            "type": "count_in_box_at_most",
            "params": {
              "kind": "block",
              "object": "purple_stained_glass_pane",
              "min": [8, 0, 7],
              "max": [12, 4, 10],
              "max_count": 4,
              "coordinate_frame": "spawn_relative"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "response_to_critic": "Accepted the high-severity issue from both CommonSenseAgent and ValidatorAgent. Reduced 'find glass' max_distance from 16 to 5 blocks. The glass structure center at (10,3,9) is ~13.7 blocks from spawn (0,0,0), so max_distance=16 would have allowed trivial completion from spawn by simply facing the right direction. With max_distance=5, the player must be within 5 blocks of the structure center horizontally, meaning they are at or inside the glass walls. This enforces the intended spatial progression: mine coal ore → walk to glass structure → mine panes inside. The other two milestones were already correct and remain unchanged.",
  "scene_clarification_request": ""
}
